  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper",
    "Add the shrimp to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade",
    "Thread the shrimp and yellow bell pepper onto skewers",
    "Grill the kebabs for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally",
    "Serve hot and garnish with fresh parsley or cilantro",
    "Let the kebabs rest for 2-3 minutes before serving",
    "Serve with a side of quinoa or couscous",
    "Garnish with lemon wedges"
